{"id": "EUVD-2026-97375", "enisaUuid": "71c638f6-bdca-3773-ade0-54a20fa3a9cc", "description": "yshop-crm through 2.1.3 contains a missing authorization vulnerability that allows any authenticated back-office user to approve or reject contracts by calling POST /admin-api/crm/contract/check. Because CrmContractController lacks @PreAuthorize and approver checks are commented out, attackers can approve contracts to alter customer deal and purchase data or reject them to return products to stock.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T13:10:33", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-12T13:10:33", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/AnkesKasty/cve-request-poc/blob/a7b6d1423555812d8efa26c91c5d0683164b31e5/yshop-crm/poc_crm_contract_check.py", "https://github.com/guchengwuyue/yshop-crm/blob/a77250f7ace63d5b6b363841d9ff441e0e2a9a6b/yshop-crm/yshop-module-crm/yshop-module-crm-biz/src/main/java/co/yixiang/yshop/module/crm/controller/admin/crmcontract/CrmContractController.java#L100-L106", "https://github.com/guchengwuyue/yshop-crm/blob/a77250f7ace63d5b6b363841d9ff441e0e2a9a6b/yshop-crm/yshop-module-crm/yshop-module-crm-biz/src/main/java/co/yixiang/yshop/module/crm/service/crmcontract/CrmContractServiceImpl.java#L315-L432", "https://github.com/guchengwuyue/yshop-crm/blob/a77250f7ace63d5b6b363841d9ff441e0e2a9a6b/yshop-crm/sql/yshop-crm-open-source.sql#L2637", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/yshop-crm-through-2.1.3-missing-authorization-via-admin-api-crm-contract-check"], "aliases": ["GHSA-h7m8-pw8h-m438", "CVE-2026-109171"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.2, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "ba4b9696-9d12-3d43-bd30-11447b7fbb8d", "product": {"name": "yshop-crm", "vendor": {"name": "guchengwuyue"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22642.1.3"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "f8332674-e67a-392b-b959-1ee432483895", "vendor": {"name": "guchengwuyue"}}], "isExploited": false}